# S-044 avio: the runner #includes the real libobs/media-io/video-io.c and audio-io.c (real threads, real loops);
# the clock, the sleep primitive, the profiler hooks, the video scaler and the audio resampler are fakes
# (gen/avio_stubs.c) that make both thread loops lock-step deterministic.
test/conformance/gen/avio_runner.c
test/conformance/gen/avio_stubs.c
libobs/media-io/video-frame.c
-Wl,--unresolved-symbols=ignore-all
-no-pie
-lm
